# The Liminal compiler bytes this repository has reviewed, by SHA-256.
#
# scripts/deploy/assemble-liminal-runtime.sh refuses to package a compiler or Cargo.lock whose
# digest is not the one pinned here. Before this file existed the release digest was computed
# from whatever binary the operator supplied, so the "reviewed" artifact was whichever one was
# on the build machine that day, and the sealed digest faithfully described it.
#
# Empty means nothing has been reviewed, which is the current state: ADR 0010 defers the
# Liminal-backed compiler and releases declare `liminal=none`. Pinning a digest is a reviewed
# change to this file, with the provenance of the bytes in the commit message.
LIMINAL_REVIEWED_EXECUTABLE_SHA256=
LIMINAL_REVIEWED_CARGO_LOCK_SHA256=
